sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Agent Panel
    participant P as OrtWebPolicy
    participant G as WebGPU adapter
    participant O as ORT Web session
    participant V as Fixed-state validation
    participant B as Batch=1 benchmark

    UI->>P: choose requested backend
    P->>G: detect adapter support
    G-->>P: support metadata or unavailable
    P->>O: create session with one explicit provider
    O-->>P: session ready for requested backend
    loop 60 fixed observations
        V->>P: infer(uint8 observation)
        P->>P: normalize / create [1, 4, 84, 84] tensor
        P->>O: session.run
        O-->>P: q_values
        P-->>V: greedy action
    end
    V-->>UI: Q error / action agreement / Q-margin
    B->>P: prepare one Float32 observation
    loop warm-up, then measured samples
        B->>P: inferPrepared(observation)
        P->>O: session.run
        O-->>B: q_values ready / elapsed time
    end
    B-->>UI: raw latency / P50 / P95
